     9	# DXB Global OS
    10	
    11	An AI-native operating system for one holding company. One human in it: the CEO. He states
    12	intent and approves what the approval gate stops at him; the OS runs the company end to end.
    13	That is the whole product — **anti-baby-sitting**. If everything else fails, intent →
