   104	
   105	## 2. The boundaries that never bend
   106	
   107	- **The approval gate.** Money OUT, contracts, ad spend, identity steps and the subjects he
   108	  marks stop at the CEO. Money IN and routine outward communication do not.
   109	- **Ask before any project work.** Nothing in the project starts until he has said so in this
   110	  conversation (CEO 2026-10-01).
